codex
The reproductions confirm the gaps: a changed/restored Go launcher can execute an outside tool while pre/post digests still match and the worker reports only one start; a failed Windows Job close is swallowed and the handle is discarded. I’m still completing the required regression and typing gates so the verdict separates functional regressions from security-contract failures.
